WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.301 --> 00:00:02.968
(calming music)

00:00:11.717 --> 00:00:15.217
(Indian meditation music)

00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:42.150
- When he's teaching class, everybody else

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:45.040
is sweltering at up to 120 degrees,

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:47.300
but he actually has a
personal air conditioner

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:50.407
blowing cold air to the back of his head.

00:00:50.407 --> 00:00:54.480
(Indian meditation music)

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:56.700
- [Liz] We had people
passing out during class.

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:58.870
We had dehydration.

00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:02.130
- You have to really dig and
find something inside yourself

00:01:02.130 --> 00:01:05.492
to actually stay and be able to bear it.

00:01:05.492 --> 00:01:08.159
(intense music)

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:16.663
- [Bikram] They want to amputate
his leg, as a President!

00:01:17.770 --> 00:01:21.510
For this, I give him seven
hydropathic treatment.

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:23.587
Bikram Yoga in the bathtub.

00:01:23.587 --> 00:01:26.254
(intense music)

00:01:27.890 --> 00:01:30.810
- [Mark] We actually
contacted the Nixon Library,

00:01:30.810 --> 00:01:33.510
gave them the time frame
when this allegedly happened.

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:37.300
The name, "Bikram Choudhury"
did not come up once.

00:01:39.190 --> 00:01:40.957
No evidence of that at all.

00:01:40.957 --> 00:01:44.207
(intense Indian music)

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:53.200
- Everything he taught was
the lesson of his master.

00:01:53.667 --> 00:01:56.917
(intense Indian music)

00:01:58.900 --> 00:02:03.720
He told that 26+2 Yoga is Bikram Yoga,

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:05.110
that is wrong.

00:02:05.110 --> 00:02:10.070
That is basically based
on my master's booklet.

00:02:10.070 --> 00:02:13.190
(intense music)

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:15.140
- Teacher Training is a feeder system

00:02:15.140 --> 00:02:17.240
into the Bikram franchise.

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:20.410
That's basically like the
cash cow for Bikram Yoga.

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:23.810
The only way you can open a
licensed, chained Bikram studio

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:25.453
is by going through training.

00:02:28.740 --> 00:02:31.000
And Bikram would hold these trainings

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:33.683
in various hotels around the world.

00:02:35.690 --> 00:02:39.710
I've seen rooms with up
to 500 people in them.

00:02:39.710 --> 00:02:42.377
(intense music)

00:02:47.450 --> 00:02:48.980
- [Trisha] And his business strategy

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:51.750
has made Bikram Choudhury a rich man.

00:02:51.750 --> 00:02:55.200
Living the life of a star,
complete with a whole fleet

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:58.070
of classic cars he's restored himself.

00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:00.680
It doesn't seem very yogi-like.

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:01.760
- [Bikram] Different which kind of yogi.

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:04.570
I'm American yogi!
(laughing)

00:03:04.570 --> 00:03:06.720
- [Trisha] Beverly
Hills yogi, to be exact.

00:03:07.942 --> 00:03:10.442
(piano music)

00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:19.300
- You were not allowed to wear any green.

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:21.090
The color green was banned.

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:22.720
- When you think about, these people

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:25.910
are starving, and they're sleep deprived,

00:03:25.910 --> 00:03:28.223
and then this yoga just wipes you out.

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:33.113
You're ripe for whatever
wants to be entered in next.

00:03:36.350 --> 00:03:40.263
- The way that they
shaped that world for us,

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:43.700
we grew to understand that the only way

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:45.984
that you could be a good
teacher, was through him.

00:03:45.984 --> 00:03:48.484
(piano music)

00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:53.673
He just kept saying, "I'm
gonna have you this time."

00:03:53.673 --> 00:03:56.980
(piano music)

00:03:56.980 --> 00:03:59.837
I thought, "He's going to rape me."

00:04:00.810 --> 00:04:03.793
- He grabbed the back of my
head and started to kiss me.

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:11.317
I immediately pulled away, and he said,

00:04:11.317 --> 00:04:14.020
"it's okay, it's okay",
and then he grabbed my head

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:17.464
and pulled me back in and
stuck his tongue in my mouth.

00:04:17.464 --> 00:04:19.964
(piano music)

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:25.420
- He had people around him who,

00:04:25.420 --> 00:04:29.230
their financial livelihood depended

00:04:29.230 --> 00:04:31.743
upon keeping the silence.

00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:34.560
- [Jakob] I know for a
fact, he abused a lot more

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:36.910
than six women, because I've talked

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:39.125
to many other women who he's abused.

00:04:39.125 --> 00:04:41.625
(piano music)

00:04:46.391 --> 00:04:48.995
(ominous music)

00:04:48.995 --> 00:04:51.080
- [Male News Anchor] He's
accused of firing his lawyer

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:54.066
for investigating claims
of sexual harassment.

00:04:54.066 --> 00:04:56.700
(ominous music)

00:04:56.700 --> 00:04:59.750
- From the time we decided
to bring the lawsuit,

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:02.804
it took three years to
get the case to trial.

00:05:02.804 --> 00:05:05.471
(ominous music)

00:05:06.930 --> 00:05:11.080
I got brutally and mercilessly
hauled into his room and told

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:15.260
unless I resigned, there and then,

00:05:15.260 --> 00:05:18.113
bad things were going to happen to me.

00:05:21.140 --> 00:05:26.140
- They found in Micki's
favor on every single claim.

00:05:26.920 --> 00:05:29.977
Unanimously, which is extraordinary.

00:05:29.977 --> 00:05:31.700
- [Female News Anchor]
Bikram Choudhury never paid

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:32.720
the judgment against him.

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:35.020
Authorities believe the
69 year old Choudhury

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:38.466
has hidden assets and
he has left the country.

00:05:38.466 --> 00:05:41.133
(ominous music)

00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:45.730
- And anybody who knows about his actions

00:05:45.730 --> 00:05:48.620
and still goes to his Teacher Trainings

00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:53.013
or carries his name, or does
anything under his banner,

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:55.573
I hope people wise up.

00:05:56.622 --> 00:05:59.289
(ominous music)

00:06:01.246 --> 00:06:02.420
- Do you think anything's changed?

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:04.080
He's back down in Mexico right now,

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:05.870
openin' up a Teacher Training,

00:06:05.870 --> 00:06:09.518
and studios are still
sending girls to him.

00:06:09.518 --> 00:06:12.185
(ominous music)

